// A bot driver doesn't sit waiting for riders who are far off (crates/game_server/src/bots/
// vehicle.rs, `riders_coming`): on Karkand (64) a bot gets the wheel of a Vodnik; squad mates
// and others on their way in within 30 m are waited for, 7 s at most (it was 14 s for anyone
// who had claimed a seat, however far away), and the driver leaves with whoever made it:
// "drives off in jep_vodnik after N s, K of 6 seats taken, M more on the way". Fails if he
// hasn't left within 12 s. We get out of its way (Kill: a soldier in front holds a driver up)
// and LogVehicles shows it on the move.
// client --scenario scenarios/vehicles/driver_short_wait.ron
(
    level: "strike_at_karkand",
    size: 64,
    team: 1,
    bots: 24,
    steps: [
        WaitReady,
        ForbidLog("panicked"),
        WaitBotsDeployed(24, 10.0),
        NearVehicle("jep_vodnik"),
        SeatBot("jep_vodnik", 1),
        LogSeats("jep_vodnik"),
        Kill,
        ExpectLog("drives off in jep_vodnik", 12.0),
        LogSeats("jep_vodnik"),
        Wait(5.0),
        LogVehicles("5 s after"),
        Quit,
    ],
)
